# The catalogue's classes are gt1030's own instructions and what its driver
# makes of the ones it has not: sm75, sm86 and rdna2, and ga104 and vangogh
# over them, do not take those prices (GA104's corpus run has the bfe step at
# 6.77 where gt1030's is 2.20).  The 64-bit integer classes are emulation and
# are carried over.
bf(x: u32) = (x >> 5) & 0xff
wide(x: u64, y: u64) = x*y + (x << 3)
use gt1030
find bf 1
cost wide
cost wide model sm75
cost wide model sm86
cost wide model ga104
cost wide model rdna2
cost wide model vangogh
use ga104
find bf 1
use vangogh
find bf 1
